    <item>
      <title>Hammerspoon 2 0.0.16</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 23:20:03 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1206</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.16</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>27.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/releases/tag/0.0.16</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h2 dir="auto">Added</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.dockicon.setMenu()</code>, which adds extra items to the menu of Hammerspoon's Dock icon, from an array of menu items or a function called each time the menu opens (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5968616740" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/334" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/334/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/334">#334</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs2 --version</code>, and hs2 now warns at startup if the running Hammerspoon 2 is a different build (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5969086313" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/335" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335">#335</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">require("node:sqlite")</code>, an implementation of Node's synchronous SQLite API (<code class="notranslate">DatabaseSync</code>/<code class="notranslate">StatementSync</code>) using the SQLite that ships with macOS, replacing v1's <code class="notranslate">hs.sqlite3</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5985255220" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/339" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/339/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/339">#339</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.eventtap.keyStroke(mods, key, app)</code> sends a keystroke with modifiers to a specific application, even in the background, without activating it (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6006017607" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350">#350</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.eventtap.makeKeyEvent()</code> and <code class="notranslate">hs.eventtap.makeKeyEventWithCode()</code> take an optional array of modifier names (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6006017607" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350">#350</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Changed</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Hammerspoon 2 now requires macOS 27 or later (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5962714189" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/330" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330">#330</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.osascript</code> async scripts now run in parallel, so their promises resolve in completion order; chain them if you need strict ordering (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5962714189" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/330" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330">#330</a>)</li>
<li>The <code class="notranslate">hs.ipc</code> broker now exits shortly after <code class="notranslate">hs.ipc</code> stops or Hammerspoon 2 quits, instead of lingering for a minute (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5969086313" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/335" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335">#335</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSApplication.title</code> has been renamed to <code class="notranslate">HSApplication.name</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5988902728" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/341" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/341/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/341">#341</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSAXElement.setAttributeValue()</code> and <code class="notranslate">performAction()</code> now throw an <code class="notranslate">Error</code> saying why the Accessibility API refused the change (with the AX error name in <code class="notranslate">err.code</code>), instead of returning <code class="notranslate">false</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6005995471" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/349" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/349/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/349">#349</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">HSEventTapEvent.flags</code> can now be set, e.g. <code class="notranslate">event.flags = ["cmd", "shift"]</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6006017607" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/350" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/350">#350</a>)</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">Fixed</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>A slow or stuck <code class="notranslate">hs.osascript</code> script no longer delays every other script until it finishes (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5962714189" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/330" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/330">#330</a>)</li>
<li>HSFont.custom() and HSFont.system(size, weight) are now callable under their documented names (they were customSize() and systemWeight()) (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5979312639" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/338" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/338/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/338">#338</a>)</li>
<li>hs.ui.webview's evalJSResult() and hs.fs.setTags(), addTags() and removeTags() now appear in the documentation (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5979312639" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/338" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/338/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/338">#338</a>)</li>
<li>After updating Hammerspoon 2, <code class="notranslate">hs.ipc</code> no longer keeps talking to the IPC broker from the previous version (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5969086313" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/335" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/335">#335</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">JSON.stringify()</code> of geometry objects (<code class="notranslate">HSPoint</code>, <code class="notranslate">HSSize</code>, <code class="notranslate">HSRect</code>), <code class="notranslate">HSColor</code>, screens, windows, applications, audio devices, Bonjour services, MIDI devices and OCR results now includes their values instead of producing <code class="notranslate">{}</code> (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5988898696" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/340" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/340/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/340">#340</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">setAttributeValue()</code> on an <code class="notranslate">hs.ax</code> element now throws an error naming the expected type (e.g. <code class="notranslate">HSPoint</code> for <code class="notranslate">AXPosition</code>) instead of silently returning false when given the wrong kind of value (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5988971438" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/342" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/342/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/342">#342</a>)</li>
<li>hs2 no longer mixes its greeting and connection notices into stdout when input is piped or redirected, so its output can be used directly in scripts (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5989167578" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/343" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/343/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/343">#343</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.window.allWindows()</code>, <code class="notranslate">hs.window.windowsForApp()</code> and <code class="notranslate">app.allWindows</code> now include windows in native fullscreen and on other Spaces (see the docs for one limitation) (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6006236228" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/351" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/351/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/351">#351</a>)</li>
<li><code class="notranslate">hs.window.windowsForApp(null)</code> returns an empty array instead of crashing (<a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="6006236228" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/351" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/351/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/351">#351</a>)</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/compare/0.0.15...0.0.16"><tt>0.0.15...0.0.16</tt></a></p>]]></description>
