    <item>
      <title>Hammerspoon 2 0.0.15</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 21:20:14 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1147</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.0.15</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/releases/tag/0.0.15</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
      <description><![CDATA[<h1 dir="auto">Added</h1>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>hs.eventtap now supports system key events (volume, brightness, media, etc)</li>
<li>hs.ui.webview pages can now send messages back into your JS config</li>
<li>hs.canvas can now fade canvases when showing/hiding/destroying</li>
<li>App updating is now implemented</li>
<li>HSAudioDevice objects now support isInUse and jackConnected</li>
<li>hs.eventtap.isSecureInputEnabled() and secureInputPID()</li>
</ul>
<h1 dir="auto">Changed</h1>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Functions/Methods that claim to return null now actually return null instead of undefined</li>
<li>hs.ax watchers will now be automatically destroyed when the elements they are watching, are destroyed</li>
<li>hs.ui's show() now orders a window to the front if it is called on an already open window</li>
<li>hs.httpserver request callback now receives query parameters as an argument</li>
<li>hs.hashing is now properly documented as hs.hashing rather than hs.hash</li>
<li>hs.midi can now open individual ports of a multi-port device</li>
<li>HSImage.copyImage() has been renamed to HSImage.duplicate()</li>
<li>hs.hotkey modals can now be created without a hotkey</li>
<li>hs.canvas minimumTextSize() can not be used without an existing element</li>
<li>HSColor objects can now be created with hex strings, colour names and more.</li>
<li>hs.canvas roundedRectRadii can now be specified with different X and Y radii</li>
</ul>
<h1 dir="auto">Fixed</h1>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>hs.ui's show() method no longer recreates the window every time it is called</li>
<li>hs.canvas' destroy() method now destroys its entire element tree, to avoid slow memory recovery</li>
</ul>
<h2 dir="auto">New Contributors</h2>
<ul dir="auto">
<li><a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/blagerweij/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/blagerweij">@blagerweij</a> made their first contribution in <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5847118357" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/issues/285" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/285/hovercard" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/pull/285">#285</a></li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto"><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/cmsj/Hammerspoon2/compare/0.0.14...0.0.15"><tt>0.0.14...0.0.15</tt></a></p>]]></description>
